OL,3,GNEWSAHackers steal children's data
OL,4,Aafter company used 'Password1' to
OL,5,Aprotect old account
OL,6,
OL,7,FA cyber-attack stole information
OL,8,Fbelonging to thousands of children by
OL,9,Faccessing an account that used the
OL,10,Fpassword "Password1", a data watchdog
OL,11,Fhas said.
OL,13,FThe Information Commission's Office
OL,14,F(ICO) has reprimanded Ogi Networks
OL,15,FLimited (ONL) and Data Cymru after the
OL,16,Fattack on 1 November 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
