PN,43402
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F434A1792603546
OL,1,W5j 5Q5j 5w{j  wsjs1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHackers steal children's data
OL,4,Aafter company used 'Password1' to
OL,5,Aprotect old account
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe hackers exposed personal
OL,8,Finformation belonging to 3,300 people,
OL,9,Fmostly children, by using a test
OL,10,Faccount, known as Test2, which had
OL,11,Fexisted for more than 12 years and was
OL,12,Fprotected by the password that could be
OL,13,Fcompromised in less than a second.
OL,15,FONL said the account "should have been
OL,16,Fremoved long before criminals were able
OL,17,Fto use it", adding it had brought in
OL,18,Findependent cyber-security specialists.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
